      "training_records：modeId、kind(training|feedback)、videoName/Type/SizeBytes/DurationSec、hintsJson、status(queued|analyzing|success|failed)、error、analysisSummary、conflict、styleCardBefore/After、progressBefore/After、stabilityBefore/After、revocable、revoked、feedbackReasons、weightChanges、createdAt",
      "image_gen_records：personName、presetId/Name、characterId/Name、projectId、promptZh、promptEn、model、quality、ratio、threeView、taskId、line(只记主机名)、status(submitted|generating|done|failed|expired)、stagedKey、mimeType、error、savedPresetId/Name、savedCharacterId/Name、createdAt、updatedAt（绝不含凭证）",
